  <language>fr_FR</language>
  <keyword>addCorrection</keyword>
  <short_description>Ajoute une correction a MException.</short_description>
  <syntax>
    <syntax_item>ME = addCorrection(ME, correction)</syntax_item>
    <syntax_item>ME = ME.addCorrection(correction)</syntax_item>
  </syntax>
  <param_input>
    <param_input_item>
      <param_name>ME</param_name>
      <param_description>un objet MException scalaire.</param_description>
    </param_input_item>
    <param_input_item>
      <param_name>correction</param_name>
      <param_description>un objet nelson.lang.correction.AppendArgumentsCorrection, nelson.lang.correction.ConvertToFunctionNotationCorrection ou nelson.lang.correction.ReplaceIdentifierCorrection.</param_description>
    </param_input_item>
  </param_input>
  <param_output>
    <param_output_item>
      <param_name>ME</param_name>
      <param_description>un nouvel objet MException contenant la correction.</param_description>
    </param_output_item>
  </param_output>
  <description>
    <p><b>addCorrection</b> renvoie un nouvel objet MException avec la propriete <b>Correction</b> definie a <b>correction</b>.</p>
    <p>Les objets de correction Nelson sont <b>nelson.lang.correction.AppendArgumentsCorrection</b>, <b>nelson.lang.correction.ConvertToFunctionNotationCorrection</b> et <b>nelson.lang.correction.ReplaceIdentifierCorrection</b>.</p>
  </description>
  <used_function />
  <bibliography />
  <examples>
    <example_item>
      <example_item_type>nelson</example_item_type>
      <example_item_description />
      <example_item_data><![CDATA[ME = MException('nelson:missingArgument', 'Missing argument.');
correction = nelson.lang.correction.AppendArgumentsCorrection('value');
ME = addCorrection(ME, correction)
ME.Correction]]></example_item_data>
    </example_item>
  </examples>
